  <item>
    <title>聊聊种地吧 | EP19 麦田第三年：后排蹦迪体验站姐零距离</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6857b0b74abe6e29cb5d648b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6857b0b74abe6e29cb5d648b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 07:49:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>麦田流水账又双叒来了！36度的气温，蔫掉的两个人，明明准备彻底摆烂的，奈何老天奶追着赏素材，瓜太多了根本吃不完啊！欢迎收听本期麦田repo，一起体验草台班子的神奇操作，偷听（bushi）站姐的工作秘辛。最后让我们在十个勤天和大家说再见的录音里结束今天的节目吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：不再幻想站立式办公</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：腘绳肌战士</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>后陡门的夏——十个勤天</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiWpFQEiVHvYqi5J6nDDgp5re-Xd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk9pY6xFvgkNRGjybb1ks2E6B-uM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsfQ9iefV1XwH9RH0ZKuSZR3FAMe.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhejcqAm8_vnAGX4ibGicdz8l_ou.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgjvN1FsFBAgp1LBuq5BgMy-bj1E.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiA3UZgByADXz-tERLjji13Qt3xX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsdJw7Lp0cBIz_Rh8DD9THWcIQTZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqyHt7ZCg3_5YyJeZaS4Zxg5Fjwr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlKzf23equ_vgEyQEpZtJ8cimJU3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhftoczZ6y7qtAJLCJ-ejQU-W-nL.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
