  <item>
    <title>聊聊种地吧 | EP17 十个勤天不是内娱限定团</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6767b5791e823e72d3c01a9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6767b5791e823e72d3c01a9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 06:51:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期核心观点见标题，十个勤天作为一个实际存在的农业公司，不同于传统认知里的爱豆限定团，除非做工商登记变更，否则十个勤天永远都是这十个人。本期剩余观点包括但不限于：群像带来的幸福消失但也没完全消失、不要夸大种地吧作为一个综艺的社会影响力、打一剂拒绝团魂绑架的预防针、从镜头占比分析135发展本职工作的合理性、十个人都对得起土地、建议追星女保持潇洒酷飒的心态、我们永远支持十个人做的所有选择。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制当天听说大家都被陪看直播哄好了（你们真的很好哄啊喂！），既然都录了，那还是放出来吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS.预祝大家新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：今天走说话难听路线的偏1团粉</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：就、还、好的电子朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑/文案】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我成为我的同时——十个勤天</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 尊重每个人的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 尊重每个人的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 种地吧已经实现预期目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 禾伙人居然也分很多种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 关于团魂的预防针</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 正视每个人的本职工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 舞台和荧屏一直是他们的初心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> 大家都要快乐追星</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lih18T4KvJ7ihevIs57TOj0I7yFW.m4a" length="50802750" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0vT0ImNk0YtfhvgnPOE1Ato3jF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>不务正乐 | EP15：喜欢童宇就对啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67239731cbe0e69c8b2b4ed6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67239731cbe0e69c8b2b4ed6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 15:01:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>趁着十月还没过完，我们赶紧把本月童宇个巡的repo抬了上来！本次个巡，童鹅带来了他的新专辑《爱情万年历》，用不同年代的曲风诠释了他对爱情的多角度理解，制作非常精良的一张专辑，强烈安利！肝老师看了杭州场，烫老师则是两场都参与了。我们聊了聊杭州场的共同记忆，饱含对童儿舞台表现的赞许，烫老师整活成功的欣喜和肝老师面签失误的悔恨。以及根据烫老师的描述，上海场吃的也有点太好了！童宇，good for you！节目后半段还是忍不住吐槽了一些演出之外的怪现象，我俩也是越来越像live判官了，如有误伤先在此滑跪致歉。最后，让我们一起喊出本期的口号：喜欢童宇就对啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：上城区听日落次数最多的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：改投童门的徐汇区周骏女友</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>日落——童宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 童宇talking好，打断talking坏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> 能吸引新粉也是极好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 童宇新专辑《爱情万年历》，请大家多多关注吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 你们tnb出来的都这么会饭撒吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 真的要夸夸VJ制作老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 一起来做马保国老师的站姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a> 烫老师硬控童宇的44秒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a> 肝老师也算是硬控住童宇了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a> 知道你们上海场吃很好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 怎么会有人连顶胯都要端水啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 烫女士收获定点饭撒全纪录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 超级敬业的童鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">42:06</a> 上城区和徐汇区最会蛐蛐的女人上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> 不买黄牛是我们最后的坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 今日排队笑话有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3302">55:02</a> 个巡，怎么跟你解释什么叫个巡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> 喜欢童宇就对啦~</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><h3><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></h3><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lstSDWG0Uq4BxqYcBBWDPFZ3jSbJ.m4a" length="62653472" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0vT0ImNk0YtfhvgnPOE1Ato3jF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>不务正乐 | EP14：芒禾治好了我想看音乐节的病</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dd1730ee04007d88ea6866</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dd1730ee04007d88ea6866</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Sep 2024 03:17:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】妈妈我们从芒禾活着回来啦！回来第一件事就是吐槽！疯狂吐槽！热到爆炸的天气、充满谎言的接驳、混乱无序的人员组织、极其离谱的硬件设施和物价，共同构成了这个史上体验最差的音乐节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：在芒禾连蹦两天活着回到上城区的蒋敦豪老婆也是吴健信徒（已婚版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：蹦迪区气氛组AKA TNB领蹦员烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>EX——旅行新蜜蜂（live ver. &nbsp;2024长荡湖芒禾音乐节，音源 by Yui衣）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>如果你还是想在夏天参加音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a>是我，是我的错，相信你的，谎言太多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a>如果混乱就是新秩序，那还是挺有序的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a>肝老师aka音乐节厕所体验官</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a>我以为的夜排vs真实的夜排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3238">53:58</a>音乐节站立区就不存在“插队”这一说，望周知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4187">1:09:47</a>一点观演礼仪方面的蛐蛐吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4615">1:16:55</a>让音乐节回归本质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4913">1:21:53</a>不会再见，也不会不舍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5149">1:25:49</a>口碑音乐节推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5249">1:27:29</a>摇滚日音乐现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5527">1:32:07</a>就好像这一刻褪去了颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5779">1:36:19</a>你的爱足有一千磅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5986">1:39:46</a>农民现场感染力还是强的，又幸福了</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..png!thumbnail"></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnLqNva8Wcnto2oxTDI1anZ8iFTu.m4a" length="104162973" type="audio/mp4"/>
