  <item>
    <title>聊聊种地吧 | EP11 2024麦田repo：爱来自后陡门58号</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666d9fddb6a8412729f96e06</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666d9fddb6a8412729f96e06</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2024 14:06:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听您的特约记者雪花电波在麦田音乐会现场发来的报道！今年已经准备在家看直播的我们突遇神兵天降，在麦田前两天收到了票，于是手忙脚乱地请假、妆发、赶路，一切似乎都和去年一样。到了现场才发现，好多东西都不同了，有进步的也有不那么进步的。好消息是该买的周边都买到啦！心心念念的那个男人也见到了！还打了招呼！鸽们今年的舞台表现和去年相比有了长足的进步，相信大家通过直播也能看到，我们则着重聊了聊在现场的感受。对于麦田前的小风波，主播们也展开了一些讨论，如有冒犯，先在这里滑跪了！另外在节目结尾有惊喜福利放出，请一定要听到最后哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS.录制期间烫感染风寒，自带鼻音电音（没有任何电鳗因本期录制而受到伤害请放心），还请大家多多包涵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PPS.本集发布前惊闻蒋敦豪要开个人专场，主播们自己都被自己开过光的嘴吓到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：上城区蒋敦豪老婆也可以是蒋敦豪老公（已婚版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：徐汇区周骏女友</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>晚安——旅行新蜜蜂</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> 这是可以说的吗（小话就要大声说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 如果注定只能一期一会，下次我会大声喊老公</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 这开了光的嘴啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 守护全世界最好的男明星们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 言出法随，他心里有我！敦门！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 脆弱时间到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> MBTI观察实录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a> 站姐这碗饭吃不了一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 我们追星女怎么这么好哄啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> 为啥今年骂声一片捏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">1:13:30</a> 打工人不为难打工人（站在世界中心呼唤爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4883">1:21:23</a> 章总您好，明人不说暗话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4972">1:22:52</a> 抽奖！抽奖！ &nbsp;限时抽奖！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2lLSlZa06C2n0Es8v_DgodI1wT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspXUhHFMx8lwRDkskjElkkKgPfk.jfif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAoY1hZ8w9L653X3obc-oQQJtIf.jfif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkroSwkIW2HeIe826Bf3sgmXv6HI.jfif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmLTbqlEITrThxUEvtbamzPSjRhC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYaw47Kt8mBrZt5QxP6P2_Aklzy.jfif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljet-TcYp6xMGCkLxpDxXPJV7BI3.jfif"></figure>]]></description>
