    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】听过EP02CP大盘点的朋友们可能知道，二位主播的记忆力媲美鱼类，对于冷门CP的互动细节一概不记得。就是这样两个人，居然敢来参加禾伙人考试！惨烈的结局是可以预见的。诚挚邀请大家和我们一起做题，看看自己能拿多少分吧！PS. 本期录制于麦田门票抽奖前，彼时的我们还很傻很天真...别笑了，孩子已经在哭了... PPS. 没有爬墙TNB，让我们热烈欢迎TNB加入这个家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子&amp;烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案，原片素材/肝子</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑/烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>龙吴路——旅行新蜜蜂</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 吃点骏敦只会让你营养均衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 金主竟成编外成员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 选择大于努力，26P敬上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 到底是谁提议的蒋敦豪工作室？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 小狼性别之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 我们星露谷玩家很严谨的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 然而真相其实是8只</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a> 抽门票了！但是TNB</span></p>]]></description>
