    <title>聊聊种地吧 | EP08 没人告诉我追线下是这样的啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a354bdab66818faf2af959</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a354bdab66818faf2af959</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jan 2024 03:27:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>预警：本期纯唠嗑，可能存在聊天内容跳跃，回环式call back的情况，主播美丽的精神状态持续走高，后半部分开启气泡音大放送（剪辑咆哮：我真的要吐了！！），请介意的朋友谨慎收听，啾咪～</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023下半年，肝烫在合适的场合见了三次电子朋友，分别是淮安、南京的音乐节和杭州的蓟州疑云。快乐浓度从出发的高铁站延续到了散场大巴！那段时间的农民可谓是百花齐放各显神通偶尔翻车时常感动！然而这几年的音乐节，似乎和我们想象的有些不太一样？进了趟剧场，有些事情也不吐不快？如果你也有共鸣或有不同的意见，欢迎在评论区和我们讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：永远被挡住的土豆</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：起承转梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>以后-蒋敦豪</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a>禾伙人浓度⚠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">05:39</a>你们26的车速真的很快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a>好消息：我老公成顶流了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a>坏消息：我俩还不熟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a>电子朋友的成功让我咬牙切齿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a>你你你你要跳舞吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a>夸夸龙宫： 干净又卫生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a>假粉锐评rapper声压</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a>禾伙人大合唱：隔壁老舅馋哭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a>嗯...怎么不算付费上班呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a>三子唱得很好，就是有点差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a>童，万万没想到你这浓眉大眼的也</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a>梦女的基本素养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1978">32:58</a>凤！凰！传！奇！（我花姐太可爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2207">36:47</a>十个勤天啥时候开演唱会啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a>TNB，长三角需要你们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a>票务疑云：肝老师痛失38</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a>就是这个票价感觉也的确是略微高了那么一些些（眼睛划船桨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a>文明观剧碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3041">50:41</a>我们i人是这样的呜呜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3197">53:17</a>童好，我们坏</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作&amp;嘉宾自荐，请联系：</span></p><span></span><p><span>alexawen0603@126.com</span></p>]]></description>
