    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Oct 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家盼了好久的蒋敦豪单线版终于上线啦！本期我们回顾了蒋董起起落落落的心酸出道史，这个曾经站上过巅峰的男人没有被平凡的日子打倒，经过几年沉淀，他似乎对自己要做的事更加坚定，更加充满信心，由此带来复杂又禁欲的领导者气质让烫肝二位老师直呼“我可以！”。希望未来的蒋董能在持续产出更多优秀音乐作品的同时，带领十个勤天继续做大做强！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：在门口徘徊的敦门信徒</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：非百分百虔诚的敦门信徒</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>乌兰巴托的夜-蒋敦豪</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a>敦门！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>敦敦初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a>多少有点不礼貌了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a>出道即巅峰，归来仍是素人（大虐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a>民选冠军！——大哥大哥你真棒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a>是深谋远虑敦了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a>朋友，我当你一世朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a>zyy痛失肝老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a>不会吧不会吧不会还有人没有被蒋敦豪唱哭吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a>铁皮火车不停开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a>起猛了，二十分钟之前有人说了啥来着？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a>起承转梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a>认真工作的男人最迷人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a>嘿嘿，我们要去淮安了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>农闲的时候，音乐节也要好好唱哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a>疯狂拉踩但没有说任何人不好的意思【滑跪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a>所以赵林林老师，团综捏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a>TNB早年珍贵影像资料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a>好好发歌，好好种地：六边形战士要赚大钱啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作&amp;嘉宾自荐，请联系：</span></p><span></span><p><span>alexawen0603@126.com</span></p>]]></description>
