    <guid isPermaLink="false">650a5e1abbe351e616672601</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Sep 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期成员单线版，我们来聊聊十个勤天的首席执行官张钥沅。十八岁的张钥沅常常感叹他的人生完蛋了，但六年后这个充满元气又甜又酷心思细腻笑声离谱做饭贼辣爱穿裙子不爱防晒的vlog之神收获了超多喜爱。感谢张钥沅，这六年来你有在好好长大。至于事业发展方面，无论种菜还是跳舞，请继续做你想做的事请吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：卓沅同款infp</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：谁还不是个infp了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大-卓沅和他的哥哥们</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a>催催团综：旅行青蛙何时聚头？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a>卓沅初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a>OOC的事情我说累了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a>肝老师从不pick庸脂薯粉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a>奶团叽是他的保护色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a>如果你愿意一层一层一层地剥开我的心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a>张老师甜妹小课堂开课了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a>那些年一生钥镪的眼泪没有白流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a>天生爱豆：快乐会传染，请你慷慨，come on~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a>CEO要的就是盘儿靓条儿顺会来事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a>一些小小私心：宝贝，搞个文凭咯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a>不建议cpf开着超载后八轮去正主面前狂舞团建啊就</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a>手绘包罗生门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a>有内鬼，终止交易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a>怎么种地也有copy cat啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a>姐粉：希望你永远真诚快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a>事业粉：首先，其次，然后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2126">35:26</a>心疼旋耕机一秒（不要心疼男人，会不幸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a>缺德粉：反正地是一定会种的咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a>男人，太费钱了</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作&amp;嘉宾自荐，请联系：</span></p><span></span><p><span>alexawen0603@126.com</span></p>]]></description>
