  <item>
    <title>聊聊种地吧 | EP05 音乐节现场碎碎念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d8c75580c9ec4c5f242e9e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d8c75580c9ec4c5f242e9e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦田音乐节结束两个月后，我们的repo终于姗姗来迟！相信大家已经从直播和正片里感受过少年们的舞台了，所以本次repo重点不在舞台！主播们将带领大家从妆造和请假开始，沉浸式体验社畜参与音乐节的全过程。我们在结尾对活动组织提出了一些建议，内含不在现场就无法感受到的奇妙气息（bushi），请一定听到最后哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>下拉获取场地导览图，一起zu进这场夏日盛会吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>肝子：耳膜粉碎者</span></p><span></span><p><span>烫：鹭卓哥哥～的小娇妻</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我会自己上厕所——宝宝巴士</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>抢票：全程白干，心态稳定，精神异常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a>那是一个阳光明媚的下午：跪谢人脉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a>最高规格妆造，社畜尽力了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a>咱就是说，也没什么当VIP的经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a>开始参观应援！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a>理解秀粉：封闭式竞争太拷问人性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a>肝老师的宏愿：我要心疼十个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a>准备进入活动场地！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a>这里瞧瞧那里看看之摄影展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a>这里瞧瞧那里看看之市集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2026">33:46</a>逛该遇到伯劳斯~好看的人都有时停魔法吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a>累了，副舞台歇jio</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a>演唱会入场了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a>主打一个内场2区气氛组担当</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2742">45:42</a>美女和老牌乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2938">48:58</a>夸夸舞美：一场笼罩你我的夏日幻梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a>现场真的很好听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3109">51:49</a>正片没有的虎哥互动的温情瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3144">52:24</a>一不小心乱入了鹭卓哥哥~的单人直拍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3278">54:38</a>三子可爱的粉丝小姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3397">56:37</a>给老公撑场子就是要嘎嘎笑啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3539">58:59</a>真诚是永远的必杀技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3739">1:02:19</a>吐槽大会时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4017">1:06:57</a>好辣眼睛的厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span>【场地导览图】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAHVYxzdXCPW9_ygT2mSkFL2LvW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>商务合作&amp;嘉宾自荐，请联系：</span></p><span></span><p><span>alexawen0603@126.com</span></p>]]></description>
